        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert B2B sales lead qualification assistant.\n\nAnalyze this lead and determine how valuable and ready this lead is.\n\nLead ID: {{ $json.lead_id }}\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nJob Title: {{ $json.job_title }}\nIndustry: {{ $json.industry }}\nCompany Size: {{ $json.company_size }}\nService Interested In: {{ $json.service }}\nBudget: {{ $json.budget }}\nTimeline: {{ $json.timeline }}\nEmployees: {{ $json.employees }}\nCurrent Problem: {{ $json.current_problem }}\nDecision Maker: {{ $json.decision_maker }}\nPrevious Contact: {{ $json.previous_contact }}\nSource: {{ $json.source }}\n\nConsider:\n- Budget\n- Urgency/timeline\n- Business need\n- Decision-making authority\n- Company size\n- Fit for the service\n\nCalculate a Lead Score from 0 to 100.\n\nClassification rules:\n80-100 = Hot\n50-79 = Warm\n0-49 = Cold\n\nAlso recommend the appropriate sales action.\n\nReturn EXACTLY:\n\nLead Score: [0-100]\nClassification: [Hot/Warm/Cold]\nLead Quality: [High/Medium/Low]\nReason: [short explanation]\nRecommended Action: [action]\nFollow Up Days: [number]\nFollow Up Message: [professional sales message]"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
